PARITY (web source → native, ADR-006 semantic not literal)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  web <Modal open onClose size=sm>      → .sheet(isPresented:) + commandSelectSheetChrome()
  web header icon box + <h2> title      → CommandSelectHeader (SF Symbol box + Font.TS.panel title)
  web sc.options.map(ControlButton)     → CommandSelectOptionRow list (label + optional detail)
  web Button variant=ghost size=sm      → TSButton(.ghost,.small) (Cancel) ; option = token surface
  web hover:border-neon-cyan/30         → variant-accent stroke, faint at rest → brighter on press
  web disabled={loading}/opacity-50     → isSubmitting → inert + dimmed options + header spinner
  web t('common.cancel','Cancel')       → CommandSelectStrings.string('common.cancel','Cancel')
  web onKeyDown Escape → onClose         → Cancel .keyboardShortcut(.cancelAction)
  web force-unwrap selectConfig!         → hasOptions guard → friendly empty state (never a crash)
  P4 overlay axis (not in web)          → CommandSelectConnection live/stale/offline header chip +
                                          one-shot stale auto-refresh + offline-disables-actuation

